WEBVTT

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:32.900
It's finally complete!

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:39.860
Firepower and strength!

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:42.570
And even its range is everything it should be!

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:46.950
With this, no one will be a
match for the fortress Fugaku!

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:49.120
An absolutely flawless giant ship!

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:53.500
You sons of bitches,
it's finally time to take on the country!

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:57.210
Boss!

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:58.630
What's up, Bekunosuke?

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:01.380
More boats have landed on the western shore.

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:04.060
They seem to be from Mori's domain this time.

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:05.510
Take them in.

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:09.060
They came looking to us for help.
We can't just ignore them.

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:12.690
Hikoji, Yataro. Put them
up in your village this time.

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:14.390
You got it!

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:19.030
Just how cruel are Toyotomi
and Mori to their people?

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:21.860
Chief Chosokabe, sir!

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:24.570
Please take us with ya, too!

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:27.030
Please let us fight by yer side!

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:30.370
We can at least cook all yer meals for ya!

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:32.330
Take us on board, Ogre Chief!

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:35.330
They're the folks from Harima and Mimasa!

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:37.460
The grandpas from Kawachi are here, too!

00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:40.130
They all feel indebted to you.

00:01:42.890 --> 00:01:44.680
Boss!

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:49.100
I appreciate the thought,
but that's as far as this goes.

00:01:49.190 --> 00:01:53.180
Pirate ships are no place for honest folk.

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:58.360
They're for ruffians who're ready
to face a watery grave at any time.

00:01:58.450 --> 00:02:01.810
More than that, your husbands
and sons who fell on the battlefield

00:02:01.910 --> 00:02:03.370
wouldn't want you to do this.

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:04.940
Isn't that right?

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:07.650
The Ogre of the Western Sea
will end this war for you!

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:09.910
Your fight will come after that.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:11.540
After you've gone back to your lands!

00:02:11.630 --> 00:02:15.120
It'll probably be harder work than
swinging around swords and spears,

00:02:15.210 --> 00:02:19.800
but you should find something
more decent worth living for there.

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:27.390
So for now, you just wait here.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:30.890
You sons of bitches, prepare for battle!

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:38.480
We'll blast away Toyotomi and Mori,
and take the country in one fell swoop!

00:02:38.570 --> 00:02:40.950
Boss!

00:04:26.090 --> 00:04:26.960
Lord Toshiie!

00:04:27.050 --> 00:04:28.260
Please wait, my lord!

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:30.210
I beg of you to wait, my lord Inuchiyo!

00:04:30.310 --> 00:04:31.390
Let me go!

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:34.060
I must go for the sake of Kaga!

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:37.560
Wielding a spear in your condition is insanity!

00:04:37.650 --> 00:04:39.060
Let go of me, Matsu!

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:40.060
Owowow...

00:04:40.150 --> 00:04:42.610
I-I am going, no matter what!

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:43.810
You leave me no choice.

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:44.650
Lady Matsu?!

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:45.780
P-Please wait!

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:47.650
Goromaru!

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:54.290
Ow, that hurt...

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:56.580
Keiji!

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:58.460
Uh, um, I'm back.

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:02.710
Matsu! Matsu! It's Keiji! Keiji's come home!

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:09.130
Keiji...

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:14.590
What was that commotion about?

00:05:14.690 --> 00:05:17.430
We have been called upon by the Toyotomi

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:19.850
to join the ranks encircling Kai.

00:05:19.940 --> 00:05:22.850
Encircle Kai? Are they going to
try to starve them out or something?

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:24.730
Matsu.

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:31.240
With Odawara and Utsunomiya
taken, Takeda is pinned down,

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:34.490
but there is no guarantee that
he will not try to attack Osaka

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:37.620
while Toyotomi's main force
has been dispatched to Aki.

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:39.920
It's true. With Chosokabe as their opponent,

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.370
things won't get settled so easily.

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:46.670
But isn't that why they took
Odawara and Utsunomiya?

00:05:46.760 --> 00:05:49.550
Kenshin joined forces with
him against the Devil King,

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:52.920
but that doesn't mean
he'll take Takeda's side again.

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:54.930
It is precisely as you say.

00:05:55.020 --> 00:05:57.510
We are likely being tested.

00:05:57.600 --> 00:06:00.590
We received word that if we do not
take action, they will destroy Kaga.

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:01.850
What?!

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:05.100
Then that's no different than
the way the Devil King ran things!

00:06:05.190 --> 00:06:07.530
No, he is different from Lord Nobunaga.

00:06:07.610 --> 00:06:11.280
Toyotomi is seeking out
only those who are truly strong.

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:12.150
My lord...

00:06:12.240 --> 00:06:16.200
To atone for the things I have
done as part of the Oda faction

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:18.370
and for the sake of the people of Kaga,

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:20.290
I will put my life on the line and fight.

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:22.040
That is...

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:24.960
That is my duty as the head of the Maeda family.

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:27.380
That is my resolve as a warrior.

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:28.800
Toshi...

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:32.340
I, Matsu, intend to stay by
your side to the very end, my lord.

00:06:32.430 --> 00:06:34.800
But I earnestly beg of
you not to strain yourself.

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:39.050
If there should come a tomorrow
when I can no longer steam rice for you...

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:42.640
Matsu, I feel the same way.

00:06:44.690 --> 00:06:48.180
I guess what I did has
backed you two into a corner.

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:50.690
That is not true, Keiji.

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:54.110
Even if the invasion of
Echigo had been successful,

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:57.280
these same circumstances
would surely have come to pass.

00:06:57.370 --> 00:07:00.530
I heard about Lady Nene from Matsu.

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:04.410
I said that Lord Hideyoshi was who
I would be if I were to lose Matsu,

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:06.840
but it seems I was wrong.

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:09.880
The strength that Lord
Hideyoshi tried to achieve...

00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:13.550
It is far beyond my comprehension as well.

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:14.800
Keiji.

00:07:14.890 --> 00:07:17.550
You need merely be true to yourself.

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:20.760
I have expressed my disapproval
in various ways in the past,

00:07:20.850 --> 00:07:23.720
but I should have given more thought

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:26.230
as to why you did not wish to become a warrior.

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:30.280
You and Lord Hideyoshi
have irreconcilable differences.

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:32.900
I, Toshiie, understand that well now.

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:35.570
There is no turning back for me now,

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:38.150
but I will say this much to you.

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:39.990
No matter what should happen,

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:43.490
it will not change the fact that we are family.

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:46.170
Toshi... Matsu...

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:54.170
A tranquil and harmonious
land of the rising sun...

00:07:54.260 --> 00:07:56.500
Tranquil and harmonious...

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:58.680
What can we do to make that...

00:08:08.940 --> 00:08:12.860
Boss, all of Mori's ships
still have their sails down!

00:08:12.950 --> 00:08:14.940
Waiting for Toyotomi to arrive, eh?

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:16.490
But they've made the first move.

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:20.690
Still, I've never heard
of Toyotomi having a navy.

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:21.900
Maybe they've read our movements

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:25.360
and there's a massive army
waiting for us on land in Aki.

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:27.590
Then, Boss, those ships of Mori's...

00:08:27.670 --> 00:08:29.910
...are to lure us in...

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:33.170
No matter how they play it, we're
still gonna get the whole lot of them!

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:34.840
We'll trample them on the attack

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:37.630
and we'll keep them at bay on
the defense. That's the Fugaku!

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:41.630
You sons of bitches, load
up the 1 1-shaku giant barrel!

00:08:41.730 --> 00:08:45.060
We're gonna blow up
Mori's ships one after another!

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:03.820
Stay on course and keep
approaching us, Chosokabe.

00:09:03.910 --> 00:09:05.450
L-Lord Mori...

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:07.750
While this may be to draw the Fugaku closer,

00:09:07.830 --> 00:09:09.540
at this rate, our losses will be...

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:11.790
It is all part of the plan.

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:14.920
Pawns will go to waste if one does
not sacrifice them at the correct time.

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:18.250
B-But my lord...

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:20.710
What do you intend to do after this?

00:09:21.770 --> 00:09:24.130
If I had declined to ally myself with Toyotomi,

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:28.060
it is self-evident that he would
have approached Chosokabe.

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:31.600
To collude with one, subdue the other,

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:34.100
and lay the foundation for conquering Kyushu.

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:35.400
That is Toyotomi's...

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:37.850
That is Takenaka Hanbei's plan.

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:40.690
I am merely trying to exploit it.

00:09:40.780 --> 00:09:42.400
Yes, Sir.

00:09:42.490 --> 00:09:45.700
Things seem to be going
according to plan, my dear Motonari.

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:47.250
We are behind by half an hour.

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:50.070
He has sunk more of my ships than calculated.

00:09:50.170 --> 00:09:53.380
You've done plenty by
drawing the Fugaku out this far.

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:56.080
Toyotomi will break Chosokabe's bones.

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:58.590
For the pound of flesh your people paid,

00:09:58.680 --> 00:10:02.760
Aki will be rewarded with certain peace.

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:05.630
Akagawa, order all the ships to retreat.

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:07.510
Yes, Sir!

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:14.770
Mori's ships are changing course!

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:17.350
It's Toyotomi! There's a whole ton of them!

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:18.700
Just as I suspected.

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:21.740
They plan to draw us close
and turn this into a land battle.

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:25.990
You're on, Mori Motonari! Toyotomi Hideyoshi!

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:31.120
That's if you guys can manage to
hold your ground until we get over there.

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:44.090
Th...

00:10:44.180 --> 00:10:45.430
That's...

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:46.270
Boss!

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:49.680
That huge enemy general's walking into the sea!

00:10:50.560 --> 00:10:53.020
What's he up to?

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:05.940
Chosokabe Motochika.

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:07.490
Prostrate yourself before the Toyotomi

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:09.440
and I would not even
begrudge you a position of power.

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:11.950
But if you would defy us...

00:11:15.460 --> 00:11:18.750
...there is nothing left but
to put you down as a rebel!

00:11:44.490 --> 00:11:46.820
He parted the sea!

00:11:46.910 --> 00:11:49.150
Th-The water's gone...

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:51.200
Wh-What the?

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:53.250
What the hell is he?!

00:11:57.550 --> 00:12:01.290
So that bastard's Toyotomi Hideyoshi.

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:04.550
B-Boss! Toyotomi and Mori are...!

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:09.220
Target that bastard! That giant
wild monkey's the Toyotomi general!

00:12:09.310 --> 00:12:11.510
Aimed and ready!

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:13.390
Fire!

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:32.570
What?!

00:12:39.800 --> 00:12:42.910
He shattered the giant barrel's
cannon ball with his bare hands?!

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:49.430
To think you would grow bold
over a mere peashooter like this.

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:51.300
It shows your quality.

00:12:51.390 --> 00:12:55.600
The Ogre of the Western Sea
would be appalled to hear of it!

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:08.520
B-Boss!

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:20.120
Unbelievable! The waters of the sea are gone!

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:23.620
Toyotomi Hideyoshi made it dry up with one fist.

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:24.470
Sasuke!

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:28.220
Master, what're you doing
getting overtaken by me?

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:30.920
I thought you would've
arrived in Satsuma long ago.

00:13:31.010 --> 00:13:33.050
F-Forgive me.

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:43.180
Master Yukimura, let us be on our way quickly.

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:44.480
Master Oyamada.

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:48.030
You saw Toyotomi's strength at Kawanakajima.

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:52.700
I believe it is only a matter of
time before Chosokabe's fortress falls.

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:54.830
What?!

00:13:55.710 --> 00:13:59.570
Don't think that this
Fugaku's just any old ship!

00:13:59.670 --> 00:14:01.620
This guy can travel on land, too!

00:14:01.710 --> 00:14:03.500
Speed it up!

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:08.920
As expected, it seems capable
of maneuvering on land as well.

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:11.800
If the dear boy Motochika
would surrender that fortress to us,

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:13.750
it would be a formidable
addition to our arsenal.

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:16.680
That will surely never happen.

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:19.510
I'm aware of their disposition.

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:22.440
What'll you do, wild monkey chief?!

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:26.360
So, you wish to become bones
upon the battlefield to further my glory.

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:41.620
Bastard...

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:04.850
So you want to go at it with me, eh?

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:09.480
I hope you know what
happens when you set foot...

00:15:09.570 --> 00:15:12.610
...in ogre territory, Toyotomi Hideyoshi.

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:14.780
Chosokabe Motochika.

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:15.900
I see it now.

00:15:15.990 --> 00:15:18.990
A fitting ogre for a small island.

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:22.450
The country of my making
has no use for pirates.

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:25.500
If you surrender this fortress Fugaku,

00:15:25.590 --> 00:15:29.670
I will make you a part of the
Toyotomi, who will pry open the world!

00:15:30.130 --> 00:15:32.090
This isn't even worth discussing!

00:15:32.180 --> 00:15:36.390
There's no way an ogre's gonna
become a monkey's underling.

00:15:36.470 --> 00:15:39.260
Then accept defeat with dignity.

00:15:39.350 --> 00:15:41.730
That will be for the good of this country.

00:15:41.810 --> 00:15:44.930
Think you can take me?!

00:15:50.650 --> 00:15:52.740
They're climbing up here!

00:15:58.120 --> 00:16:00.360
According to what we heard along the way,

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:03.120
people who were rendered
destitute due to Toyotomi's conscription

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:05.790
and the people of lands defeated
by Mori all looked to Lord Chosokabe

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:09.710
and it is said that he has taken them all in.

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:11.330
Once they bring the Inland
Sea of Seto under their control,

00:16:11.420 --> 00:16:14.260
they will finally begin their
invasion of Kyushu in earnest.

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:17.090
Getting ahead of them and
preventing that from happening

00:16:17.180 --> 00:16:20.050
is the mission that you
and we were entrusted with.

00:16:20.140 --> 00:16:23.100
Up until now, partly in
accordance with our lord's wishes,

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:26.180
we have done as you saw fit, Master Yukimura.

00:16:26.270 --> 00:16:27.560
But I, Oyamada,

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:30.140
cannot yield to your decision here and now.

00:16:30.230 --> 00:16:31.690
Master Sanada.

00:16:31.780 --> 00:16:34.240
Right now, you're the
commander of your own force.

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:37.530
Think on things with your position in mind.

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:43.660
The Inland Sea of Seto is my backyard!

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:47.620
No one gets away with wreaking havoc in it!

00:16:49.090 --> 00:16:52.300
The world you see is too small.

00:17:10.070 --> 00:17:12.270
Narrow-minded pirate,

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:14.770
feel shame in your weakness.

00:17:14.860 --> 00:17:17.020
Strength is what will
bring prosperity to the land

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:20.230
and it is the strong who will rule the world.

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:23.490
That's the trouble with monkeys.
They're too simpleminded.

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:26.740
I'll be damned if I let you have your
way with the Inland Sea of Seto here,

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:30.620
or the land of the rising sun.

00:17:30.710 --> 00:17:33.370
Before you look at the world,

00:17:33.460 --> 00:17:36.500
there are other things that you should...

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:39.300
...pay attention to!

00:17:49.650 --> 00:17:51.430
Foolishness.

00:17:59.070 --> 00:18:02.030
You are weak. You cannot break me!

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:17.160
Boss!

00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:20.250
We will reinforce the Chosokabe Army!

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:22.010
The outcome is clear already!

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:23.510
Master, what you should do right now is...

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:27.590
I... I cannot overlook this, Sasuke!

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:29.390
Master!

00:18:29.480 --> 00:18:31.390
Young sir Oyamada!

00:18:33.110 --> 00:18:36.190
I understand, Master Yukimura.

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:39.990
What is the matter?

00:18:40.070 --> 00:18:43.360
No, I was just a little surprised.

00:18:43.450 --> 00:18:45.780
It seems a force that was not
supposed to be on this battlefield

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:47.830
has slipped in to join the battle.

00:18:49.210 --> 00:18:51.540
Takeda of Kai...

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:54.580
What have they come to
accomplish with such a paltry force?

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:57.960
I, Sanada Genjiro Yukimura, of the Takeda Army

00:18:58.050 --> 00:19:00.960
offer my support to Master Chosokabe!

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:02.630
Clear a path for Master Yukimura to retreat!

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:09.380
--Master Oyamada!
--Master Oyamada!

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:11.260
Master Oyamada!

00:21:12.390 --> 00:21:13.970
Master Oyamada!

00:21:30.530 --> 00:21:34.620
That didn't hurt one bit.

00:21:34.710 --> 00:21:36.540
Y-You sons of bitches...

00:21:36.620 --> 00:21:38.660
Get back...

00:21:38.750 --> 00:21:40.910
...to the Fugaku!

00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:44.250
Ogre of a lonely island,

00:21:44.340 --> 00:21:49.080
go scavenge among the mountains
of bodies in the depths of Hell.

00:21:49.180 --> 00:21:54.550
I'll show you the way we pirates do things!

00:22:22.550 --> 00:22:24.330
Boss!

00:22:30.050 --> 00:22:33.260
Withdraw! Our victory is secure!

00:23:11.090 --> 00:23:14.840
Some land's fallen to the Toyotomi.

00:23:14.930 --> 00:23:18.510
Maybe Shikoku or thereabouts went belly up.

00:23:18.600 --> 00:23:20.140
How good.

00:23:20.230 --> 00:23:22.840
If they expand their territory in advance,

00:23:22.940 --> 00:23:27.930
it'll make it that much easier for
this dragon to take the country.

00:23:28.030 --> 00:23:30.560
Smack down Toyotomi and it'll be all over.

00:23:30.650 --> 00:23:32.910
I'll take back what's mine

00:23:32.990 --> 00:23:34.700
and get my hands on the rest!

00:23:41.750 --> 00:23:44.330
No one's a match for Miyamoto Musashi!

00:23:44.420 --> 00:23:45.950
Sorry to keep you guys waiting!

00:23:46.630 --> 00:23:49.460
Next time, the legend of my supreme power!

00:23:49.550 --> 00:23:50.300
Killer Technique, Sound Thrashing!

00:23:51.720 --> 00:23:53.050
You better watch it, no matter what!

00:23:53.140 --> 00:23:56.000
I'll use the ace up my sleeve right off the bat!
